  m_text: 'Fixed Rich Text icons not displaying correctly inside tooltips.

    Improved
    Token tooltip interaction during combat.

    Fixed enemy positioning in combat.

    Fixed
    issues with audio settings.

    Fixed and updated combat interfaces and skill
    icons.

    Improved and optimized several visual effects.

    Improved various
    underlying gameplay systems through refactoring.'
