  m_text: "Rotten Fairy:\n\nAdded the new Rotten Fairy version.\nUpdated Fairy animations:\n\tIdle;\n\tLight
    Attack;\n\tHit Taken;\n\tDeath.\nAdded new Fairy animations:\n\tHeavy Attack;\n\tSelf
    Buff;\n\tParty Buff.\n\nCombat Assets:\n\nUpdated enemy portraits in the Combat
    HUD.\nUpdated enemy positioning during combat.\nFixed the Buck model.\n\nItems:\n\nAdded
    new item icons to the Market."
