    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'New Systems:


    Added a Dialogue System, allowing the creation of dialogue
    trees for character interactions.

    Added a Torch System.

    Added a Stamina
    System.

    Added a Safe Area System.

    Added Save Slots and integrated them
    with the game''s other systems.

    Added Exploration Save/Load, allowing the
    exploration scenario to be saved and loaded.

    Added an Object Placement System.

    Added
    a dedicated service for physics-based movement logic.

    Added a character
    movement system using physics.

    Added Combat Speed controls.


    Skill
    & Character Systems:


    Refactored the character skills system.

    Updated
    character base kits and skill trees.

    Updated Wulfric''s skills in the Skill
    Tree.


    System Refactoring:


    Refactored the Health Bar system.

    Refactored
    the Corruption Bar system.

    Refactored the Item Base system.

    Refactored
    the Chest system.

    Refactored the Item Generation system.

    Refactored
    the Inventory system.

    Refactored the Shop system.

    Refactored the Exploration
    Enemy AI.

    Refactored the Character Switching system.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f8e6024aadc5a046ade11ad5290a252, type: 2}
