  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "New Interfaces & Content:\n\nAdded a new Splash Screen.\nAdded a new Tutorial.\nAdded
    a new Almanac.\nAdded a Skill Panel with Rich Text and Token/DoT icons in skill
    descriptions.\nAdded Combat Cheat activation indicators.\nAdded visual settings
    for enabling or disabling Film Grain and other visual effects.\nAdded an option
    to enable or disable the Cursor.\n\nInterface Redesign:\n\nChanged the game's
    main font from Edo to MedievalSharp.\nRedesigned and animated all game interfaces.\n\tPause
    Menu: \n\t- Added a sliding screen transition with a black gradient background.\n\tSettings,
    Extras, Credits & Patch Notes:\n\t- Added a paper-opening transition;\n\t- Content
    now appears as the paper opens;\n\t- Buttons slide into view behind the content.\n\tCharacter
    Selection:\n\t- Redesigned the layout;\n\t- Added new colors;\n\t- Added a new
    sliding screen transition.\n\nUI Improvements:\n\nAdded new styles and visual
    details to Sliders, Scrollbars, and Handles.\nImproved Token tooltips during
    combat.\nAdded Rich Text icon support inside tooltips.\nRemoved the yellow damage
    preview from enemy health bars when hovering over them.\nUpdated combat skill
    icons.\nImproved the combat interface."
