  m_text: 'Visual Improvements:


    Updated anomaly materials.

    Updated the
    village protection circle.

    Updated lamp post materials.

    Updated metallic
    materials.

    Updated the Global Volume.

    Optimized fire effects.

    Optimized
    light insect effects.

    Optimized fog effects.

    Optimized blood effects.

    Added
    new Corrupted Flame effects.


    Cursor:


    Updated the cursor visual effect,
    changing its color from purple to red.


    Exploration UI:


    Added control
    icons to the Exploration UI.

    Added a Stamina Bar to the Exploration UI.'
